  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Resilience through Improved Climate and Hydrometorological-services (EnRICH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is expected to strengthen Bangladesh&apos;s flood forecasting and early warning capabilities. By the end of the implementation period, the Flood Forecasting and Warning Centre (FFWC) will have integrated additional meteorological data streams into its operations, and increased forecasting coverage in the eastern region, specifically Sylhet, Sunamganj and Feni.</narrative>
  </description>
